#coachInboxNudgeComingSoonModal.modal.fade{tabindex: "-1", "aria-labelledby": "coachInboxNudgeComingSoonLabel", "aria-hidden": "true"}
  .modal-dialog
    .modal-content
      .modal-header
        %h5#coachInboxNudgeComingSoonLabel.modal-title Nudge — Coming soon
        %button.btn-close{type: "button", data: { "bs-dismiss": "modal" }, "aria-label": "Close"}
      .modal-body
        %p.mb-2
          Real Slack nudges are not wired yet on Coach Inbox.
        %p.mb-0.text-muted
          When they ship, you’ll choose whether to nudge the
          %strong employee
          , their
          %strong manager
          , or
          %strong both
          — so nudging never has to feel like tattling.
      .modal-footer
        %button.btn.btn-primary{type: "button", data: { "bs-dismiss": "modal" }} Got it
